    <string name="pad_face_layout_title">Button layout (guide only)</string>
    <string name="pad_face_layout_summary">Where the guide draws A / B / X / Y. The buttons keep their roles. Auto picks the Nintendo layout on Anbernic devices (RG477V and others) and the AYN Thor.</string>
