    <string name="pad_tuning_category_title">Feel</string>
    <string name="pad_left_select_title">Left stick: tilt that selects a key (%)</string>
    <string name="pad_left_select_summary">Tilt further than this to select a key. Smaller is more sensitive.</string>
    <string name="pad_left_release_title">Left stick: tilt that returns to the center key (%)</string>
    <string name="pad_left_release_summary">Below this the center key is selected again. Keep it smaller than the value above.</string>
    <string name="pad_flick_title">Right stick: tilt that counts as a flick (%)</string>
    <string name="pad_flick_summary">Tilt further than this to flick.</string>
    <string name="pad_flick_return_title">Right stick: tilt that counts as back (%)</string>
    <string name="pad_flick_return_summary">The character is typed the moment the stick comes back below this.</string>
    <string name="pad_trigger_title">Analog L2 / R2: press depth (%)</string>
    <string name="pad_trigger_summary">Used only when the device reports L2 / R2 as axes rather than buttons.</string>
    <string name="pad_repeat_delay_title">Hold to delete: delay before repeating (ms)</string>
    <string name="pad_repeat_delay_summary">Hold B to keep deleting.</string>
    <string name="pad_repeat_interval_title">Hold to delete: repeat interval (ms)</string>
    <string name="pad_repeat_interval_summary">Smaller deletes faster.</string>
    <string name="pad_roles_category_title">Button roles</string>
    <string name="pad_roles_category_summary">The same roles in every mode. Hold roles change the character only while held (a role that does nothing in a mode shows an empty pill in the guide). Symbols: while held, the left stick types symbols. The handakuten and small kana roles type numbers in English while held. L3 / R3: previous / next mode (only when clicked without tilting the stick). D-pad: cursor. While converting: ←→ candidates, ↑ longer range, ↓ shorter range.</string>
    <string name="pad_role_confirm">Enter (confirms while converting)</string>
    <string name="pad_role_backspace">Delete one character (while converting too: leaves the conversion and deletes)</string>
    <string name="pad_role_space">Space</string>
    <string name="pad_role_convert_next">Convert / next suggestion</string>
    <string name="pad_role_previous_candidate">Previous suggestion</string>
    <string name="pad_role_touch_keyboard">Touch keyboard (switches between the guide and the touch keys of the mode). Hold to hide the keyboard</string>
    <string name="pad_role_hold_dakuten">Hold: dakuten (か→が). Upper case in English</string>
    <string name="pad_role_hold_handakuten">Hold: handakuten (は→ぱ). Numbers in English</string>
    <string name="pad_role_hold_small">Hold: small kana (つ→っ, や→ゃ). Numbers in English</string>
    <string name="pad_role_hold_small_or_handakuten">Hold: small kana, handakuten on the は row. Numbers in English</string>
    <string name="pad_role_hold_uppercase">Hold: upper case (English)</string>
    <string name="pad_role_hide">Hide the keyboard</string>
